Package: rism
Type: Package
Title: Radiomic Feature Integration with Spike-and-Slab for Multimodal Survival Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sagnik", "Bhadury", email = "bhadury@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits a Cox proportional hazards model with a grouped
    spike-and-slab prior over predictor groups (e.g. radiomic feature
    families, or feature groups from different data modalities), via a
    Metropolis-Hastings / Gibbs MCMC sampler with adaptive proposal scaling
    and likelihood tempering during burn-in. Provides posterior inclusion
    probabilities per group, posterior summaries for the regression
    coefficients, and convergence diagnostics.
